response:
UAC-0056 conducted a phishing campaign targeting Ukrainian state organizations, impersonating the National Health Service of Ukraine. The campaign distributed emails with links to a ZIP archive on Discord. The archive contained a decoy document and LNK shortcut files triggering PowerShell commands to download and run OutSteel, which steals documents and subsequently downloads SaintBot.

